# No AI git attribution (canonical)

This project's conception, architecture, and authorship belong to the human owner (Sodawave / SodaWave). Agents and tools are assistants only.

## Binds

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `cursoragent@cursor.com`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any similar AI/tool trailer to commits or PRs.
- Never set commit/PR author or committer to Cursor, cursoragent, or any agent identity.
- Never claim co-authorship, ownership, or licensing of this work for Cursor or any model/agent.
- When committing: use plain `git commit` messages from the human/project voice only. If a harness injects trailers, strip them before push (prefer `.githooks/prepare-commit-msg`).

## Prevents

- Re-enabling Cursor/CLI `attribution.attributeCommitsToAgent` / `attributePRsToAgent` for this repo.
- Inventing product conception, architecture ownership, or license claims as agent work.
